1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":-24.45,"default_fair_val":-24.45,"premium_pct":-268.2,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":19.8,"pe_forward":17.4,"pb_trailing":1.7,"pb_forward":1.5,"div_yield":5.82,"ps_ratio":187.9,"fcf_to_ev":0.08,"fcf_to_mcap":0.13,"liab_to_assets":53.2,"cash_to_assets":0,"current_ratio":0.46,"roe":8.7,"roa":4.1,"moat":{"ticker":"NNN","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 在零售地產領域的品牌定價權相對較弱。其營運的購物中心和零售空間主要依賴租戶的品牌吸引力，而非 NNN 本身的品牌價值。租戶議價能力較強，尤其是在競爭激烈的市場中，這限制了 NNN 透過租金顯著提高定價的能力。雖然公司努力提升資產價值和租戶組合，但其核心業務模式並未賦予其強大的品牌定價壁壘，難以與擁有強大品牌效應的消費品公司相比。","comment_en":"NNN REIT has relatively weak brand pricing power in the retail real estate sector. Its operated malls and retail spaces primarily rely on the brand appeal of its tenants, rather than NNN's own brand value. Tenants possess significant bargaining power, especially in competitive markets, which limits NNN's ability to significantly increase pricing through rents. While the company strives to enhance asset value and tenant mix, its core business model does not grant it strong brand pricing barriers, making it difficult to compare with consumer goods companies possessing strong brand effects."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 作為一家房地產投資信託基金，其業務模式不涉及專利或受嚴格監管的特許經營權。房地產行業的進入壁壘主要來自於資本需求、土地獲取和開發許可，而非專利保護。因此，在專利和監管特許權這一維度上，NNN 不具備任何實質性的經濟護城河。其營運受制於地方政府的土地使用法規和建築規範，但這並非能轉化為競爭優勢的特許權。","comment_en":"As a Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT), NNN REIT's business model does not involve patents or strictly regulated franchises. Entry barriers in the real estate industry primarily stem from capital requirements, land acquisition, and development permits, rather than patent protection. Therefore, NNN possesses no substantial economic moat in terms of patents and regulatory franchises. Its operations are subject to local government land-use regulations and building codes, but these do not translate into competitive advantages as franchises."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的轉換成本中等。對於租戶而言，搬遷至新的零售空間涉及相當大的成本，包括裝修、設備遷移、供應鏈調整以及潛在的業務中斷。然而，若租戶發現有更具吸引力或更符合其需求的租賃條件，這些成本仍可能被克服。對於 REIT 而言，吸引新租戶並替換現有租戶也需要時間和資源。因此，雖然存在一定的轉換成本，但並非不可逾越的壁壘。","comment_en":"NNN REIT has moderate switching costs. For tenants, relocating to a new retail space involves considerable expenses, including renovations, equipment relocation, supply chain adjustments, and potential business disruptions. However, these costs can still be overcome if tenants find more attractive or suitable leasing terms elsewhere. For the REIT, attracting new tenants and replacing existing ones also requires time and resources. Therefore, while some switching costs exist, they do not represent an insurmountable barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的業務模式幾乎不存在網絡效應。網絡效應通常出現在平台型業務中，用戶越多，價值越大。在零售地產領域，雖然一個成功的購物中心能吸引更多客流，進而吸引更多租戶，形成一種正向循環，但這更多是規模和地點的結果，而非真正的網絡效應。每個租戶和消費者都是獨立的個體，其價值並非直接與其他用戶的數量呈指數級增長。","comment_en":"NNN REIT's business model exhibits virtually no network effects. Network effects typically occur in platform-based businesses where more users lead to greater value. In the retail real estate sector, while a successful shopping center can attract more foot traffic, thereby attracting more tenants and creating a positive cycle, this is more a result of scale and location rather than true network effects. Each tenant and consumer is an independent entity, and their value does not grow exponentially with the number of other users."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 在規模經濟方面具有一定的優勢。作為一家大型 REIT，其在採購、融資、物業管理和營銷方面可能獲得比小型競爭對手更優惠的條款。龐大的資產組合有助於分散風險，並可能透過集中採購和管理來降低營運成本。然而，房地產行業的規模優勢並非絕對，地點和資產質量往往比單純的規模更重要，且大型 REIT 的管理複雜性也可能增加成本。","comment_en":"NNN REIT possesses certain advantages in terms of economies of scale. As a large REIT, it may obtain more favorable terms in procurement, financing, property management, and marketing compared to smaller competitors. Its substantial portfolio helps diversify risks and may reduce operating costs through centralized purchasing and management. However, the scale advantage in the real estate industry is not absolute; location and asset quality often outweigh sheer size. Furthermore, the complexity of managing a large REIT can also increase costs."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的部分資產可能位於獨特的地理位置，這構成了其護城河的一部分。優越的地理位置，例如位於高人流量的城市中心或高增長地區，能吸引優質租戶並支撐較高的租金水平。然而，房地產的獨特性是相對的，其他競爭者也可能在相似的優越地點開發項目。因此，其獨特地理位置的壁壘強度取決於具體地點的稀缺性和不可替代性。","comment_en":"Some of NNN REIT's assets may be situated in unique geographic locations, forming part of its moat. Prime locations, such as those in high-traffic urban centers or high-growth areas, can attract quality tenants and support higher rental rates. However, the uniqueness of real estate is relative, and competitors may also develop projects in similarly advantageous locations. Therefore, the strength of its unique geographic asset barrier depends on the scarcity and irreplaceability of specific locations."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 在營運效率方面表現穩健。作為一家成熟的 REIT，公司應具備高效的資產管理、租戶關係維護和成本控制能力。透過精細化的營運管理，可以最大化資產的租金收入並降低空置率。其 F-Score 為 5/9，顯示其在財務健康度方面尚可，但並非頂尖。持續的營運效率是 REIT 保持競爭力的關鍵，但若無顯著的技術或流程創新，其效率優勢難以形成難以逾越的壁壘。","comment_en":"NNN REIT demonstrates solid operational efficiency. As an established REIT, the company should possess efficient asset management, tenant relationship maintenance, and cost control capabilities. Through meticulous operational management, it can maximize rental income from its assets and minimize vacancy rates. Its F-Score of 5/9 indicates a moderate level of financial health, but not top-tier. Sustained operational efficiency is crucial for REITs to maintain competitiveness, but without significant technological or process innovations, its efficiency advantage is unlikely to form an insurmountable barrier."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的資本配置能力尚可。其 ROE 8.7% 和 ROA 4.1% 表明其資產回報率處於中等水平。然而，其高負債水平（$4,993.9M 負債對 $2.7M 現金）顯示其財務槓桿較高，這可能限制其未來的擴張和靈活性。有效的資本配置對於 REIT 至關重要，包括審慎的收購、開發和股息分配。若能持續以高於資本成本的效率進行再投資，將能鞏固其護城河。","comment_en":"NNN REIT's capital allocation capabilities are moderate. Its ROE of 8.7% and ROA of 4.1% indicate mid-level asset returns. However, its high debt level ($4,993.9M in debt versus $2.7M in cash) suggests significant financial leverage, which could constrain future expansion and flexibility. Effective capital allocation is vital for REITs, encompassing prudent acquisitions, development, and dividend distribution. The ability to consistently reinvest capital at rates exceeding the cost of capital would strengthen its moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的客戶（租戶）保留率中等。如前所述，租戶搬遷存在一定成本，這有助於提高保留率。然而，租戶的業務表現、市場趨勢以及租賃合約的到期都會影響其保留意願。NNN REIT 需要持續提供有吸引力的租賃條件和良好的物業管理服務來維持租戶關係。與強大的品牌忠誠度不同，租戶的忠誠度更多是基於經濟和營運考量，而非情感聯繫。","comment_en":"NNN REIT's customer (tenant) retention rate is moderate. As mentioned earlier, tenant relocation involves certain costs, which helps improve retention. However, the tenant's business performance, market trends, and lease expiration dates all influence their willingness to stay. NNN REIT must continuously offer attractive leasing terms and good property management services to maintain tenant relationships. Unlike strong brand loyalty, tenant loyalty is more based on economic and operational considerations rather than emotional connection."},"m10_durability":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"NNN REIT 的業務模式具有一定的持久性，但面臨零售行業的結構性挑戰。房地產本身是相對穩定的資產，能夠提供長期的現金流。然而，零售業態正經歷電子商務的衝擊和消費者偏好的轉變，這對傳統購物中心 REIT 構成壓力。NNN REIT 的持久性取決於其適應變化的能力，例如轉型為體驗式零售、混合用途開發或專注於特定利基市場。其目前的財務狀況和資產組合使其具備一定的韌性，但長期前景仍有不確定性。","comment_en":"NNN REIT's business model has a degree of durability but faces structural challenges in the retail sector. Real estate itself is a relatively stable asset capable of generating long-term cash flow. However, the retail industry is undergoing disruption from e-commerce and shifts in consumer preferences, putting pressure on traditional shopping center REITs. NNN REIT's durability depends on its ability to adapt to changes, such as transforming into experiential retail, mixed-use developments, or focusing on specific niche markets. Its current financial condition and asset portfolio provide some resilience, but long-term prospects remain uncertain."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"NNN REIT 的經濟護城河整體偏弱，主要體現在其品牌定價權和網絡效應的匱乏。儘管在地理位置、規模和營運效率方面具有一定的優勢，但這些壁壘相對容易被競爭對手模仿或克服。高轉換成本和客戶保留率提供了一定的穩定性，但不足以構成強大的護城河。其業務模式更接近於一種『收費橋』的屬性，依賴於其擁有的資產位置和租賃合約，而非難以複製的競爭優勢。零售行業的結構性挑戰也對其長期持久性構成威脅。總體而言，NNN 的護城河強度中等偏下，投資需謹慎評估其風險與回報。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"NNN REIT's economic moat is generally weak, primarily due to its lack of brand pricing power and network effects. While it possesses some advantages in terms of location, scale, and operational efficiency, these barriers are relatively easy for competitors to imitate or overcome. High switching costs and customer retention rates provide some stability but are insufficient to form a strong moat. Its business model is closer to a 'toll bridge' property, relying on the location of its assets and lease agreements rather than inimitable competitive advantages. Structural challenges in the retail industry also pose a threat to its long-term durability. Overall, NNN's moat strength is below average, and investments require careful assessment of risks and returns.","evidenceHash":"1e7dd875218c911970b18367e54410c946330ab36e0dbe0799efa296612c01c6","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"1e7dd875218c911970b18367e54410c946330ab36e0dbe0799efa296612c01c6","currentEvidenceHash":"1e7dd875218c911970b18367e54410c946330ab36e0dbe0799efa296612c01c6"},"fScore":{"score":5,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T10:02:29.953Z","evidenceHash":"a6f1c73ccf24c42aa6ad7ca4032376b70d366384dd3226212bd6bfb85d79877d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-08T10:02:29.953Z","evidenceHash":"a6f1c73ccf24c42aa6ad7ca4032376b70d366384dd3226212bd6bfb85d79877d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NNN.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/NNN.png","website":"https://www.nnnreit.com","ceo":"Stephen A. Horn Jr.","full_time_employees":"85","description":"NNN REIT, Inc. is a REIT that invests in high-quality properties subjected generally to long-term, net leases with minimal ongoing capital expenditures. As of June 30, 2026, the Company owned 3,774 properties across 50 states, the District of Columbia and Puerto Rico, encompassing approximately 40.4 million square feet of gross leasable area, with a weighted average remaining lease term of 10.1 years. NNN REIT, Inc. was incorporated in August 1984 in Maryland and is based in Orlando, Florida.","description_en":"NNN REIT, Inc. is a REIT that invests in high-quality properties subjected generally to long-term, net leases with minimal ongoing capital expenditures. As of June 30, 2026, the Company owned 3,774 properties across 50 states, the District of Columbia and Puerto Rico, encompassing approximately 40.4 million square feet of gross leasable area, with a weighted average remaining lease term of 10.1 years. NNN REIT, Inc. was incorporated in August 1984 in Maryland and is based in Orlando, Florida.","description_zh":"**NNN REIT, Inc. (NNN) 業務營運概述**\n\nNNN REIT, Inc. 是一家專注於投資高品質不動產的房地產投資信託基金（REIT）。其核心營運模式為持有並出租具備長期淨租約（Net Lease）特性的資產，此類租約通常要求承租方負責物業的營運維護與稅費，大幅降低本公司持續性的資本支出需求。\n\n截至 2026 年 6 月 30 日，NNN REIT, Inc. 在美國 50 個州、華盛頓特區及波多黎各共計擁有 3,774 處物業，總計約 4,040 萬平方英尺的可出租面積。這些資產的平均剩餘租賃年期為 10.1 年。公司成立於 1984 年 8 月，總部位於佛羅里達州奧蘭多。其主要業務板塊涵蓋多元化的租賃不動產，包括零售、辦公、工業及醫療保健等領域，藉由穩定的租金收入與低資本支出，追求長期穩健的股東報酬。","address":"450 South Orange Avenue","city":"Orlando","state":"FL","zip":"32801-9803","country":"US","phone":"407-666-7348","full_address":"450 South Orange Avenue, Orlando, FL 32801-9803, US","range_52w":"38.9-50","year_high":50,"year_low":38.9,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":38.9,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"Witherspoon Kamau Omari","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1607,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.07},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"MUELLER CHARLES E JR","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1550,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.06},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"HOLDEN BETSY D","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1444,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.06},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"Gulacsy Elizabeth","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1229,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"FRITSCH EDWARD J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1296,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.05},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"FICK DAVID M","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":2049,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.09},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"Chiu Christina","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":963,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-11-02","name":"Beall Pamela K.M.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":963,"price":41.52,"total_val":0.04},{"date":"2026-10-08","name":"MUELLER CHARLES E JR","title":"Officer / Director","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-08","name":"Chiu Christina","title":"Offic